  "releaseNotes": "# Performance\n\t\t- Greatly improved OverWrite performance for #LoopRow / #LoopRowData with large data sets (rows are now inserted in bulk before copying instead of one block at a time; roughly 40x faster on a 1,000-row nested loop). Thanks to @meld-cp.\n\n\t\t# Adjustment\n\t\t- Row and column range detection (used by OverWrite, ReadAllTexts and ReadAllObjects) now includes cells that only have formatting or merged ranges, not just cells with values. As a result, ReadAllTexts / ReadAllObjects may return additional empty trailing rows or columns for sheets that contain formatted but empty cells.",
